# Case documents exported to the repo root (call printouts, record exports).
# These carry LAW ENFORCEMENT SENSITIVE content — caller numbers, call SIDs,
# officer names — and must never enter git history, where deletion does not
# remove them. Root-anchored so the tracked PDF snapshot fixtures under
# client/src/utils/pdf/v2/__tests__/__snapshots__/ are unaffected.
/*.pdf

